<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#374151;margin-bottom:20px;">The <strong style="color:#0f172a;">median home price in Tampa Florida</strong> as of early 2026 is approximately $415,000 for the metro area. Here is how Tampa Bay cities and other major Florida markets compare right now:</p>

