<ul style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#374151;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px;">
<li style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#374151;margin-bottom:8px;">Waterfront under $600K (still seeing multiple offers)</li>
<li style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#374151;margin-bottom:8px;">Top school zones in South Tampa, Brickell, Windermere (limited inventory)</li>
